  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Crossbody for the errand. Shoulder bag for the dinner. Our 454 mini crossbody in smooth leather converts between the two without any fuss—just swap the strap and go. It's finished with silver hardware, a snap closure, and a zip pocket inside. We love a bag that can multitask.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Smooth leather</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 8&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable and removeable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop, shoulder strap with 8&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.16&quot; (L) x 4.6&quot; (H) x 3.60&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
